ead leads through personalized email and follow-up sequences, converting them into qualified appointments without additional ad spend.\\n\\n2. Pain Point: Time-intensive manual operations for agent support, training, and marketing coordination, diverting resources from scaling the business and boosting agent productivity.\\nSupporting Evidence: The company promotes a collaborative culture with ongoing coaching, training, and teamwork to help agents grow, placing significant operational demands on the marketing and operations manager; as a smaller brokerage in a multi-tenant office building, manual processes can hinder scalability in attracting new clients or agents.\\nOffer: Automate lead nurturing and appointment setting workflows with AI to deliver hot, ready-to-close leads directly to your agents, freeing up your team's hours for high-value tasks like strategy and training.\"]}","Email#1 Body":"Hey Joseph,<br><br>Noticed Main + Main has been building since 1997—that's a solid foundation in real estate.<br><br>With market pressures like rising costs squeezing margins, every lead counts more these days.<br><br>As a smaller team of 17, chasing down old inquiries manually probably eats up your time, leaving potential sales and rentals on the table.<br><br>We've been working on a way to reactivate those without extra effort or ad spend.<br><br>Want me to pencil you in for 15 minutes Thursday?<br><br>You might find our approach unexpected.","Email#1 Subject":"Joseph + dead leads","Email #2 Body":"Hey Joseph,<br><br>Just pushing this back up your inbox in case you missed it.<br><br>Look forward to hearing from you.","Email#3 Body":"Hey Joseph,<br><br>Running marketing and ops for a brokerage like Main + Main means juggling a lot—training agents, coordinating marketing, all while keeping the pipeline flowing.<br><br>Those manual tasks divert focus from scaling, especially when old leads from past showings or rentals sit untouched in a competitive Irvine market.<br><br>We've built something that automates the follow-up and nurturing, handing off only the hot ones to your team.<br><br>If you're curious, reply and I'll share more.<br><br>It's a shift from the usual tools out there.","Email#3 Subject":"Joseph, ops efficiency","Sender Email":"nick@nexgenwellness.org","Time Zone":"T1","Email#1 Sent":1,"Email#2 Sent":"","Email#3 Sent":"","Message ID":"a2cdad46-2bc8-fdba-ef88-7defd59290d9@nexgenwellness.org","threadId":"","Clicked?":1,"Opened?":1,"Replied":"","Token":"SGQAY8","Opted Out":"","Seen E1":1,"Seen E2":"","Seen E3":"","Clicked e1":2,"Clicked e2":"","Clicked e3":"","Email 1 Sent":"05/04/2025, 09.04","Email 2 Sent":"","Email 3 Sent":"","Next Email Date":"05.10.2025"}}]},"versionId":"d0bf0bc1-0ecb-463c-a70e-85b97bd553c6","triggerCount":0,"shared":[{"createdAt":"2025-06-28T08:48:38.940Z","updatedAt":"2025-06-28T08:48:38.940Z","role":"workflow:owner","workflowId":"EQXk6wRdknz7U00j","projectId":"roCKyeuuwaNdcgDf"}],"tags":[{"createdAt":"2025-06-28T08:46:14.709Z","updatedAt":"2025-06-28T08:46:14.709Z","id":"JGJfysfhf1IrX4ig","name":"misel"}]}